<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Deals & Secrets | Sewer Mazes & UFO Keys" description="Unlock hidden areas in Sell Lemons! Solve the sewer maze, decode the 5-color lever puzzle, get the UFO key, and read honest gamepass reviews.">
  <main>
    <!-- Page Hero Section -->
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Endgame Unlocks</p>
          <h1>Endgame Secrets & Keys: Complete Maze Walkthrough</h1>
          <p>Hidden Secrets & Keys are not just collectibles. They directly impact your progression in Sell Lemons. Complete these quests to solve sewer mazes, locate hidden keys, and scale your lemonade empire efficiently.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons secrets guide" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Detailed Guide Content -->
    <article class="guide-detail">
      <ArticleAd />
      <h2>The Secrets & Gamepass Blueprint</h2>
      <div class="guide-step-flow">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 1: The Sewer Key & Maze Entry</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Secret Unlock:</strong> The Sewer Key unlocks the underground sewer system, which contains rare items, Cosmic Cash Vines, and hidden quest progression.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong> Navigate the dark sewers to locate the hidden lever chambers. Because the patterns are complex, prepare with a map or follow our 5-color lever layout in Step 2.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 2: The 5-Color Lever Puzzle Sequence</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Secret Unlock:</strong> Opening the underground steel vault door.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong> Locate the 5 colored levers inside the maze. Pull them in the exact verified sequence to release the vault locks. Opening the vault grants immediate access to the Cosmic Cash Vine chamber.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 3: The UFO Key Quest & Good Samaritan Badge</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Secret Unlock:</strong> Triggers the UFO event zone with special spawn mechanics and a permanent F2P Investor multiplier.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong> Solve the Good Samaritan puzzle inside the sewers to retrieve the UFO Key. Walking to the UFO site with the key active rewards you with a permanent +1% to +2% Investor Multiplier (the maximum possible for free-to-play players).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 4: Gamepass Evaluation (God-Tier vs. Traps)</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Secret Unlock:</strong> Optimize your real Robux investments.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>God-Tier:</strong> "Double Investors" Gamepass (stacks up to 4 times) and the 4-stack Speed Gamepass. Essential for leaderboard competitive progression.</li>
                <li><strong>Traps:</strong> Buying early Lemon X sources or managers directly. Their slow base speed makes them highly inefficient without stacking global multipliers first.</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- What to Do Next Section -->
      <section class="guide-what-next" aria-labelledby="guide-what-next-title">
        <header class="guide-what-next__head">
          <span class="guide-what-next__icon" aria-hidden="true">🎁</span>
          <h2 id="guide-what-next-title">What to Do Next</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="guide-what-next__divider" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span>
          <span class="guide-what-next__diamond"></span>
          <span></span>
        </div>
        <a class="guide-what-next__cta" href="/codes/">
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">🎁</span>
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-copy">
            <strong>👉 Check Active Codes</strong>
            <span>Claim free boosts, cash bonuses, and speed increases before they expire.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-chevron" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="deals" />
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
